OL,3,ACanadian poet Anne Carson wins Nobel
OL,4,APrize in Literature
OL,5,
OL,6,FCanadian poet, essayist and translator
OL,7,FAnne Carson has been awarded this
OL,8,Fyear's Nobel Prize in Literature.
OL,10,FCarson, 76, is celebrated for works
OL,11,Fthat often cross the boundaries between
OL,12,Fpoetry, fiction and scholarship.
OL,14,FThe Nobel Prize committee said they had
OL,15,Fselected her "for her bold and
OL,16,Finventive oeuvre that, in playful
OL,17,Fdialogue with the classical tradition,
OL,18,Fhas created new forms for contemporary
OL,19,Fliterature".
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/19
