OL,3,ACanadian poet Anne Carson wins Nobel
OL,4,APrize in Literature
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Nobel Prize is awarded for a
OL,7,Flifetime's body of work and is
OL,8,Fregareded as the most prestigious award
OL,9,Fin global literature with the winner
OL,10,Freceiving 12 million Swedish kronor
OL,11,F(#900,000, $1.2m).
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/19
